      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwezi ogwomusanvu ng'Abaisiraeli boonaboona bamaze okuja mu bibuga byaibwe era nga batyaime batereire, beesololeza e Yerusalemu boonaboona nga bali kitole. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 27:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Agho Yeshua mutabane wa Yozadaki, ni bakabona baine, ni Zerubbabeli mutabane wa Shealutieli aghalala n'aboluganda lwe, baazimba buyaaka alutaari ya Katonda wa Isiraeli, ey'okugheerangaku ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa, nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa mu Mateeka ga Musa omuntu wa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.28.1+NUM.28.2+NUM.28.3+NUM.28.4+NUM.28.5+NUM.28.6+NUM.28.7+NUM.28.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 28:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baazimba alutaari eyo mu kifo kye yalimu mu kusooka, waire nga baali batya abantu be baayagaana nga n'ababa mu biketezo ebyo. Era baaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda, ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa ku alutaari eyo, buli nkyo n'eigulo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 29:12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Baakolanga embaga ey'Ekibinuko eky'Entindi nga bwe kyaghandiikibwa, era baaghangayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa ebya buli lunaku, nga bajiira ku mikuzi amateeka ge giragira okubighaayo ku lunaku olwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kub 28:11—29:39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwe baamalanga ekyo baayongeranga okughaayo ebigheebwayo ebya buli lunaku ebyokebwa byonabyona okuwaagho, n'ebigheebwayo ku mbaga edh'Ekibinuko eky'Okuboneka kw'Omwezi, n'ebigheebwayo ku mbaga edh'ebibinuko ebindi Musengwa Katonda bye yalagira, n'ebigheebwayo ebya buli muntu eby'ekyeyendere. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuviira irala ku lunaku olusooka olw'omwezi ogwomusanvu, baatoolera okughaayo ebigheebwayo ebyokebwa eri Musengwa Katonda, waire ng'omusingi ogw'eisinzizo baali bakaali na kugutaagho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
